{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "Wait. What are we actually trying to do?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Produce Future Radio.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Without going bankrupt.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And get people to listen.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Preferably.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "And make more of it.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "With what money?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "That's the problem!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Which problem?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know what it costs to make the show.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "I have been saying that for weeks.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "You keep telling us what we've spent.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Not what it should cost.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "...Continue.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Every episode is different. Different scripts. Different models. Different voices. Different production processes.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Different failures.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "And we're learning things every time. But we can't compare the results.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Because we have no standard unit.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A standardized radio episode.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Exactly!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A tragic phrase.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "I like it.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We need a benchmark episode.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What would it measure?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Everything we need to know to make the next one better.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      }
    ],
